            ("What standard hardness test indents a material with a diamond cone or hardened steel ball under a major load, reading hardness directly from penetration depth?", "The Rockwell Hardness Test (HRC / HRB)", ["The Brinell Hardness Test", "The Vickers Hardness Test", "The Knoop Microhardness Test"], "Rockwell tests are rapid and non-destructive, using minor and major preload depths to calculate hardness without optical microscopes."),
