            ("What standard published by the National Fire Protection Association establishes electrical safety requirements and arc flash PPE categories for workplaces?", "NFPA 70E (Standard for Electrical Safety in the Workplace)", ["NFPA 70 (National Electrical Code)", "NFPA 101 (Life Safety Code)", "NFPA 72 (National Fire Alarm Code)"], "NFPA 70E prescribes shock boundaries, arc flash risk assessments, energized work permits, and Personal Protective Equipment (PPE) categories."),
